\par\par \b \uc2  SAfrica's Stals says rand currently undervalued. \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1998\par 16:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JOHANNESBURG, July 30 (Reuters) - South African Reserve Bank governor Chris Stals said on Thursday that the heavy losses of the rand in an 11 week \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis had thrust the unit into oversold territory against the country's main trading partners. \par \par \uc2  "If you look at the average weighted value of the rand against the (trade weighted) basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...we have seen a depreciation of 20 percent. That is more than can be justified in terms of inflation differentials," he said. \par \par \uc2  Stals, speaking to journalists after addressing a South African Chamber of Business conference, said that the rand appeared to be stablising and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been able to withdraw from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for much of July. \par \par \uc2  "We \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first week of July but since then the market has become much more quiet and volumes have declined. On a net basis there was not that much \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the last three weeks," he said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has slumped 20 percent since late May in the face of speculative attack, as widening concerns over emerging markets shook investor confidence worldwide and made the unit an easy target for foreign sellers. \par \par \uc2  Stals said that the rand now appeared cheap - but declined to predict when it might recover - if ever. \par \par \uc2  "The rand is certainly undervalued at the present level. But what is the right exchange rate and where will it be at the end of this year? (That) no one can really predict or forecast." \par \par \uc2  ((-Johannesburg newsroom, 27-11-482-1003 newsroom@reuters.co.za)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du7u02rxt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
