\par\par \b \uc2  S. Africa's Stals -2: Confusion Over Fed, BOE  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Juni 1998\par 17:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials contacted at the weekend were adamant the Fed and the BOE were using South African \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds - not their own - to support the rand. This is a crucial issue as it means speculators aren't suddenly pitted against the financial might of two of the world's biggest central banks as they seek to pummel the rand. \par \par \uc2  Stals said he didn't want to comment on the nature of Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  until he has discussed these events with the deputy governors and department heads who oversaw the Reserve Bank's actions. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief was with visiting French President Jacques Chirac's entourage Friday evening as the dollar was bounding to its new record high at ZAR5.9650. \par \par \uc2  But Stals pointed out that the Reserve Bank holds part of its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves with other central banks and some commercial institutions abroad for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  outside South African trading hours. \par \par \uc2  Given the latest attack on the rand occurred during New York trading, he said "little should be made" that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was funded from the bank's accounts at the Fed and the BOE. \par \par \uc2  However, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials in \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2  conceded that there was a different twist to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday, as dealers at the U.S. and U.K. central banks acted directly in addition to passing on the South African Reserve Bank's funds to commercial traders. \par \par \uc2  This aspect created the greatest furor in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as it appeared the Fed and the BOE were prepared to put their own funds into supporting the rand. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 28-06-98 \par \par \uc2  1504GMT \par \par \uc2  1192 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6s05hlw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
