\par\par \b \uc2  SAfrica cbk says not defending set dlr/rand level. \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JOHANNESBURG, April 1 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Reserve Bank said on Wednesday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to smooth volatile conditions but said it was not defending any specific dollar/rand level. \par \par \uc2  "I think we have a concern if the rand were to move very sharply on the back of speculative trading, but are not protecting any particular level," said Bertus van Zyl, the Reserve Bank's general manager of international banking. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, traders said they believed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold dollars for rand at 5.0450 in order to steady the rand's depreciation. \par \par \uc2  "There seems to be evidence that he (the Bank) is coming in around those levels (5.0450/dlr) but it is nothing aggressive. It's just leaning against the wind," said a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer earlier. \par \par \uc2  When asked if the Bank was comfortable with a gradual easing in the rand's value against the dollar, Van Zyl answered "yes" and added that its involvement had been a precautionary measure to ensure an orderly market. \par \par \uc2  His comments followed those of Reserve Bank governor Chris Stals to a South African newspaper that he was "not unhappy" with the rand's recent slip to record lows against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Van Zyl would not say to what extent the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold dollars or bought rand. \par \par \uc2  The rand slipped above the pyschologically important 5.00/dlr threshold on Monday after a spate of mixed economic data and in the face of a rampant dollar. \par \par \uc2  ((-Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11-482-1003 newsroom@reuters.co.za)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du410893v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
